          </ClipRRect>
        </Positioned>
        <Positioned left="240" top="128">
          <Text fontSize="16" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">连字一起糊</Text>
        </Positioned>
        <Positioned left="24" top="188">
          <Text fontSize="18" color="#16233A" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">裁剪决定效果停在哪里</Text>
        </Positioned>
      </Stack>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="64" top="543" width="400">
      <Text fontSize="20" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">看图：左卡字清楚、右卡连字一起糊，两张卡的 sigma 都是 6。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="64" top="601.4" width="400">
      <Text fontSize="20" color="#78879C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">插图由本页 DSL 构件直接画成，未嵌入预渲染整图。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="510" top="254">
      <Container width="4" height="24" color="#2B5BD7" borderRadius="2"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="526" top="250" width="626">
      <Text fontSize="26" color="#16233A" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" fontStyle="BOLD">BackdropFilter 糊已经画好的背景</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="526" top="281.56" width="626">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">它自己什么都不画，子节点叠在模糊结果之上，所以文字仍然清晰</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="510" top="364.04">
      <Container width="4" height="24" color="#2B5BD7" borderRadius="2"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="526" top="360.04" width="626">
      <Text fontSize="26" color="#16233A" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" fontStyle="BOLD">ImageFiltered 糊整棵子树</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="526" top="391.6" width="626">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">子树里的色块、文字、描边会被一起模糊</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="510" top="439.04">
      <Container width="4" height="24" color="#2B5BD7" borderRadius="2"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="526" top="435.04" width="626">
      <Text fontSize="26" color="#16233A" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" fontStyle="BOLD">作用范围由外层裁剪决定</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="526" top="466.6" width="626">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">Stack 默认 HARD_EDGE，滤镜柔化会外溢，用 ClipRRect / ClipOval 圈住</Text>
