    <Positioned left="65" top="1205.8" width="1087">
      <Text fontSize="28" color="#16233A" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" fontStyle="BOLD">三、常见误解与动手核对</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="48" top="1243.8" width="532">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#7A4FD3" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" fontStyle="BOLD">容易踩的坑</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="620" top="1243.8" width="532">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#1F8A5F" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" fontStyle="BOLD">动手核对</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="50" top="1286.8">
      <Container width="10" height="10" color="#7A4FD3" borderRadius="5"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="72" top="1277.8" width="506">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">以为 BackdropFilter 会糊自己的子节点：不会，子节点是叠在结果上面的。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="50" top="1359.28">
      <Container width="10" height="10" color="#7A4FD3" borderRadius="5"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="72" top="1350.28" width="506">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">以为换滤镜就能自动限定区域：范围只由外层裁剪决定，去掉裁剪就溢出去。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="623" top="1286.8">
      <Container width="13" height="13" borderRadius="2" border="2 SOLID #1F8A5F"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="646" top="1277.8" width="506">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">同一场景分别用两种滤镜渲染，比较文字是否变糊</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="623" top="1359.28">
      <Container width="13" height="13" borderRadius="2" border="2 SOLID #1F8A5F"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="646" top="1350.28" width="506">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">去掉外层 ClipRRect，观察柔化是否溢到相邻区域</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="623" top="1431.76">
      <Container width="13" height="13" borderRadius="2" border="2 SOLID #1F8A5F"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="646" top="1422.76" width="506">
      <Text fontSize="24" color="#42536E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">最终图放大看局部、缩略看整体，确认没有遮挡与裁切</Text>
    </Positioned>
